+	.string "You made it! I'm Xiaoyu,\nyour Taichung city guide.\pWelcome to Old Station.\nYour city story starts here.\pRed brick and a clock tower.\nThe city has stories to share.\pOld streets, green corridors,\nmuseums full of surprises...\pAnd ice cream at Miyahara!\nI never skip a sweet detour.\pMeet our City League leaders.\nWin badges at open gyms.$"
 
