+# Approved architecture study archive
+
+`approved-study-archive.json` indexes byte-identical copies of the four approved
+high-resolution architecture studies and17 inspected reference images. The local
+archive is at `artifacts/approved-landmark-studies/v1/` relative to the workspace
+root, outside the isolated worktree artifact namespace. Each entry records the
+source path, byte length and SHA256. Exact prompts, reference URLs and generation
+measurements remain in the corresponding landmark directories.
+
+Keep these masters when cleaning a worktree or replacing a native candidate.
+Native indexed rasters have separate geometry, palette and runtime validation.
+The later illustrated poster can reuse the approved architecture references;
+its final streets and landmark placement follow the completed map contract.
+Poster style studies and format choices remain separate design records.
