+# Landmark art workstream: first priority
+
+The user split expansion into geography, a reusable normal-building/prop library,
+and landmark customization. This stream starts with Old Taichung Station because
+it is the selected arrival point. It does not expand all ten landmarks at once.
+
+Ownership and shared acceptance rules are recorded in
+[`city-v2-workstreams.md`](city-v2-workstreams.md).
+
+## Order and bounded deliverables
+
+| Priority | Place | First useful deliverable |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 1 — native integration | Old Station | Approved study, indexed native bank and fixed footprint/door; see native validation notes |
+| 2 — active | National Taichung Theater | Approved curved facade / glass study and native-size candidate |
+| 3 — proposed later | Miyahara | Brick corner facade / shop identity using the shared city kit where practical |
+| 3 — proposed later | Taichung Park | Pavilion, pond edge and park identity using shared landscaping assets |
+| Remaining | Other selected gym landmarks | Reference and bespoke art after the shared pipeline and priorities are reviewed |
+
+These priorities are implementation proposals; the approved gym roster remains
+all ten existing landmark IDs. A visually distinctive building does not allocate
+a trainer, badge, battle roster or progression flag.
+
+## Station package
+
+`data/taichung/landmarks/old-station/` contains `references.json`, `placement.json`,
+the exact `generation-prompt.txt` and `art-brief.md`. Photographs were retrieved
+7 November2026 from Taichung's official cultural heritage and film-assistance sites
+and inspected locally. They show a charcoal/slate roof, cream bands, red brick,
+central clock tower, tall arched center and low front canopy.
+
+The proposed rendering envelope is12×8 metatiles /192×128 logical pixels. The
+active door remains(32,64) in `MAP_TAICHUNG_OLD_CITY`; approach(32,65), arrival(30,66),
+gym ID and return warps remain fixed. The proposal extends the current placeholder
+one tile north and west and does not change native source by itself.
+
+The initial targets were two secondary palette banks,224 unique8×8 graphics and
+96 metatile definitions. The measured conversion uses one palette,225 Station
+graphics and64 shared graphics, within384 total slots. Palette7 carries Station
+art and12 remains available for normal-building colors. The source integration
+and checks are described in [`city-v2-station-native.md`](city-v2-station-native.md).
+
+## Sources
+
+- [Taichung Cultural Heritage Department: Station and frontal photo](https://www.tchac.taichung.gov.tw/building?pid=1&uid=33).
+- [Taichung Film Assistance: Station scene photographs](https://filmtaichung.org.tw/en/scenesContent/233).
+- [Taichung Tourism: architectural identifying features](https://travel.taichung.gov.tw/en/attractions/intro/1568).
+- Native source: `include/fieldmap.h`, `src/field_door.c`, and the existing city contract.
+
+No downloaded reference photograph is a shipped game asset. The initial generated
+study also remains separate from an accepted native tile asset until measured,
+converted, registered and tested. Root owns that integration.
+
+## First generated study and validation
+
+One built-in `image_gen` call generated the architectural study saved at
+`artifacts/worktrees/c291d4842985/landmark-art/old-station-study-v1.png`. The exact
+prompt is versioned in the Station package and `generation.json` records its
+reference inputs, SHA-256 and measured properties. The real Station's features are
+recognizable in this study. The separate indexed conversion is now registered in
+the isolated mapping checkout; Main owns canonical release integration.
+
+Requested raster dimensions passed(1536×1024). Native-readiness checks failed:
+the output retains a soft halo,255 alpha levels,105,423 distinct visible RGBA values
+and no uniform8×8 logical-pixel blocks among the13,383 blocks containing visible
+pixels. It needs deliberate native-resolution cleanup, hard alpha, per-tile palette
+assignment, deduplication and ROM validation. Keep `nativeReady=false` until those
+steps are complete for each derived asset. The original study's failed raster
+properties stay recorded; the derived native file has its own readiness and QA.
+No optional redraw was spent changing architecture that matches the reference.
