+`candidate-v2/` and `native-candidate-v2.json` preserve this separate result.
+The immediate preview is `landmark-art/miyahara-native-candidate-v2.png`.
+It keeps the 160×128 canvas, 128×76 body at (0,52), full architecture, binary alpha
