+
+V2 checks pass for the exact palette, binary alpha, all 20,480 native pixels
+through packed 4bpp/flips, deterministic rebuilding and actual gbagfx agreement.
+All 14 hashed V1/source files remain unchanged. The extra 6 unique graphics add no
