+# CMP Park Lane native increment
+
+This isolated increment installs the already approved CMP planted facade as the Calligraphy Greenway gym anchor. It preserves the e9 Science Museum, Shen Ji, Fine Arts/sculpture and previously released Old City/Theater assets. The scene baseline is e9a854b; the complete input/candidate baseline is38c6172.
+
+The9×10-metatile building begins at18,27. Its one native door remains22,36, with approach22,37 and arrival22,39. All four Greenway gyms retain their exterior warps and twelve interior returns. The General door replaces the measured bottom-center painted cell; its actual animation and alignment need native acceptance. The space south of the building remains native park lawn/paving rather than another baked landscape.
+
+The private primary preserves278 raw graphics at identical addresses:228 protected General/animation slots and50 additional border-referenced slots. It relocates the350 old secondary patterns into primary holes, then uses12 remaining primary slots and248 secondary slots for CMP. The loaded secondary sheet is256 tiles, below the door scratch range1016–1023. All207 old secondary metatile IDs, their RGB renders/attributes, and all86 protected General definitions remain unchanged. CMP adds81 definitions for288 total. Palette8 changes only seven proven-unused indices8,9,10,11,12,14,15; loaded index0 and every old used color remain exact. All1,530 connected-strip cells retain exact map words, entry words, rendered RGB and attributes.
+
+The engine now compares the outgoing/incoming primary pointers during a camera connection. A changed primary uses the existing heap-backed full tileset and palette loaders, applies current weather gamma to BG banks0–12 and initializes both animation callbacks. The unchanged-primary path retains the existing secondary-only behavior. Object graphics, palettes and player state use the existing transition path. The General animation destinations remain protected. This asynchronous loader change requires native acceptance; source checks alone do not establish upload timing, task/heap pressure, weather/tint appearance or seamless movement.
+
+Reproduce with the project's Python3.11/Pillow interpreter:
+
+```
+python3 -B tools/taichung/landmarks/compile_cmp.py
+python3 -B tools/taichung/landmarks/install_cmp.py
+python3 -B tools/taichung/landmarks/check_cmp.py --self-test
+python3 -B tools/taichung/landmarks/check_old_core.py --self-test --json
+python3 -B tools/taichung/export_minimap.py --check
+```
+
+The independent checker reconstructs the scene from the frozen map and candidate pixels, resolves actual C bank declarations, compares preserved rendering/addresses, and rejects protected-pixel, palette, native-door, layer and old-camera-loader corruption. The compiler writes only its new bank/artifact paths. The installer owns shared declarations/layout/map registration. Rebuilding a registered increment must be followed by installation again before validation; never run the frozen e9 compiler over this new registered scene.
+
+The exact source delta has80 changed map words and57 formerly ordinary positions made invalid by the larger building. All1938 current ordinary positions remain in the Science-arrival component. Main owns the next save version, cached-Greenway refresh, exact57 conditional relocations and integration with prior29 e9 changes. The existing delta producer supports `--baseline38c617288cb4a5220c75e914d916054b1530d9f9` and an isolated `--output`; its inherited save-v5 purpose label is historical and does not allocate the next version. Keep every currently valid coordinate. Bank relocation by itself does not justify moving a player. The minimap geometry fingerprint stays924380bc…31722, while its source provenance is regenerated; fingerprint equality does not prove old cached-view compatibility.
+
+Native acceptance must cover the CMP approach/door/return, facade collision/player layering, walking/biking all four directed city boundaries, existing landmark appearance and save/reset/Continue. Native QA belongs to an isolated exact-source ROM and a documented SRAM fixture. Main alone owns canonical integration, source export and publication. The live Theater/Park release remains the fallback; unregistered Xitun work must not be mixed into this checkpoint.
