+# Final three approved landmark candidates
+
+The user has approved the architectural direction of all ten landmarks. The e9a854b Greenway installation is a separate immutable checkpoint; none of the candidates below changes its registered banks, maps, C code or save version.
+
+| Landmark | Selected encoded input | Pixels | Flip-deduplicated graphics before bank reuse |
