+# Ten short bilingual exterior landmark signs
+
+Exact Story handoff `content/story/landmark-signs-handoff.json`, SHA-256 `9c5e3916f03c2d968bd51f704527c84dda85f8124e5be688ead08e6ba1da1553`, is integrated on base `31aae01c66bf09011c0d4a8ac91856d364f21db8`. Each existing exterior sign now shows the place name and one local hook in a single two-line English or Traditional Chinese box. No leader biography or battle availability claim was added.
+
+Only the ten `TaichungCity_Text_*` assembly payloads and their existing `sZh_TaichungCity_Text_*` array literals changed. All labels, pointer lookups, `MSGBOX_SIGN` calls and the rest of both source files remain byte-identical to baseline. No host conversation, coordinates, map geometry, warp, save variable, progress, renderer or challenge-readiness change. `landmark-signs-binding.json` records exact pairs; `landmark-signs-translations.json` is a ten-entry fragment for Main to merge into the separately owned root corpus.
+
+Static native-width review measures the actual Normal/Male/Female Latin glyph-width tables and encoded Chinese12px advances: all20locale/sign pairs fit the208px message window, maximum170px. Two14px rows at y1/y16 occupy30px within the32px window. Native encoding and isolated compilation pass. The built ROM SHA-256 is `c98c52e8a435f9b49bd12cbf2658dda4973725bc233027929615d5b1e9d0266a`; EWRAM remains261180bytes. This checkpoint has **not yet received native sign language/wrapping UI acceptance**; await Main's explicit browser lease and record runtime evidence separately.
+
+The existing append-only helper added30glyphs at indices417–446 (447total), preserving every released417mapping and bitmap row exactly. `landmark-signs-glyphs.json` gives exact character/code and hash ledger. Root sorted regeneration is unsuitable because it would renumber the released prefix. Use:
+
+```sh
+PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=/Users/peter/devday_hackathon/.tools/python-lib /Users/peter/.pyenv/versions/3.11.15/bin/python3 tools/taichung_gameplay/extend-chinese-glyphs.py --game "$PWD" --font /Users/peter/devday_hackathon/.tools/fonts/NotoSansTC.ttf --artifacts /absolute/artifact/path --write
+```
+
+Repeating the helper after this checkpoint adds zero glyphs. Later Miyahara/onboarding branches must reconcile new characters against this447glyph prefix and append only missing characters, preserving these assignments. Main alone integrates/publishes. All compile/font/static-review artifacts are isolated under the parent project's `artifacts/worktrees/284bed0e4a4d/`; no canonical cartridge or earlier CMP evidence was changed.
