+# Final two facades: isolated release preparation
+
+This checkout starts from Main's accepted CMP native source `5d6039c` and applies the existing combined Fengjia/Maple increment `cb4486a`. It does not include the parent Miyahara street-layout increment `961dcce`, the Miyahara battle slice, or the city-v3 studies. Both facades remain one increment; no separate staged overlay or extra save-version split was introduced.
+
+Xitun's map, registered private-bank graphics, palettes, definitions, attributes and C bindings are the existing frozen cb inputs. JASC-PAL checkout line endings follow the repository's CRLF attribute; parsed colors and canonical Git contents remain identical. Old City and Greenway map bytes, exterior event JSONs, city geometry contract, save source and overworld loader remain exactly the Main-CMP baseline.
+
+The only merge-conflict resolution is validation tooling. `check_cmp.py` starts from Main's reviewed `31aae01` guard, retaining its eight sections and exact v6 save/header bindings. It delegates only the named final-Xitun bank pair to the independent Xitun guard and allows only those two layout-bank fields to differ from the reviewed geometry. Old City has no Miyahara allowance. Nineteen corruption probes, including unrelated Old City/layout changes, are rejected.
+
+The original installation manifest's source-baseline961 field describes the frozen proposal's generation provenance; it is not a statement that this checkout contains that street change. Do not rewrite the immutable art manifests merely to change that provenance label.
+
+Save-v7 migration and its reviewed bindings remain Main-owned. This preparation checkout retains native v6 and cannot demonstrate migration of a pre-final Xitun map cache. Its safe isolated rendering/door test fixture is the explicit post-CMP Greenway save at43:1(22,37), counter8; enter Xitun normally so the new source map is loaded. Current-postinstall Save/Continue and Main's later integrated old-cache migration are separate acceptance gates.
+
+Native acceptance must verify both entrances/returns, Maple paths/pond blocking/foreground, preserved Theater, Xitun/Greenway foot and bike crossings, and native Save/Reset/Continue with a released-input movement check. A final integrated candidate must then pass Main's v7 old-save and client gates. Canonical integration and publication remain Main-owned.
