+                   "Fengjia has opaque dark lane art and no painted gym door; Root must decide the entry treatment.",
+                   "General definitions outside the86-ID compatibility closure are not promised unchanged rendering.",
+                   "Dynamic engine behavior, animation execution, caches and boundary-transition VRAM reload remain runtime work."],
+        "registeredInSource": False, "geometryApproved": False, "runtimeVerified": False, "nativeReady": False,
